@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18080
@memberToken = 替换为买家登录返回的token
@adminToken = 替换为管理员登录返回的token
@devKey = 替换为本地开发密钥

# 本文件为逐步手工演示；将响应中的ID和业务号填入后续请求。
# 所有金额均为整数分。不要把真实凭证保存或提交到仓库。


@skuId = 1
@templateId = 1

### 创建优惠券；演示前修改有效期为当前时间附近
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/v1/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"满30减5","thresholdFen":3000,"discountFen":500,"total":100,"validFrom":"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z","validUntil":"2027-11-11T00:00:00Z"}

### 领取，记下返回的个人券 id，不能把模板 id 直接当个人券 id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons/{{templateId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 我的券
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### 加入购物车
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skuId":"{{skuId}}","quantity":2}

### 查看购物车
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
